{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061787/block/singleImage/3256636/df/01M6GBQWG3EZGYQGANYBP34V6J.jpg?updatedAt=1793698194\"/><figcaption>九龍塘廣播道42號。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>九龍塘廣播道發生火警。 今日（11月3日）下午3時許，九龍塘廣播道42號一個單位懷疑燒着雜物冒煙起火，多名住戶走火警逃生。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，迅速將火救熄。火警中暫未有受傷報告，起火原因仍在調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:09.333966+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:29:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.981598+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:31.572849+00:00","content_hash":"c7f46284d10d20b91d937fb920e2f1ec5993958cdbfe67f7134ce656b6055869","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:09.333966+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}